And especially if it's a show that is as narratively complex is how I made your mother you you had to do a lot of like Training of your audience to watch the show and that was our argument to keep it We said let's keep it because this will show people that we're gonna be jumping around all the time It'll it'll keep you on your toes.
特别是如果这是一个叙事复杂的节目，就像我如何让你的母亲成为你一样，你必须做很多事情，比如训练你的观众观看节目，这是我们保留它的理由，我们说让我们保留它，因为这会向人们表明我们将一直跳来跳去，它会让你保持警惕。

